#. module: hr_rfid
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:hr_rfid.hr_rfid_webstack_action
msgid ""
"<b>What are Modules?</b><br>\n"
"                    Modules (WebStacks) are network devices that manage "
"communication between Odoo and your access control hardware (controllers, "
"doors, and card readers)."
